The '''Mysterious Force''' is one of the [[Into the Future]] [[Treasure]]s. Like the [[Turbo Machine]] with which it stacks, it improves the [[Cat Cannon]]'s recharge speed.

==Effect==
Each Mysterious Force reduces the [[Cat Cannon]]'s recharge time by a maximum of 10 seconds.

When a player has activated Mysterious Force at 100% in all three chapters, the Cat Cannon's recharge time is reduced by 30 seconds.

