==Trivia==
*In spite of being listed fourth in the [[Treasure]] menu, the Mysterious Force is actually the fifth obtainable Into the Future Treasure.
*The Mysterious Force and the [[Turbo Machine]] are the only Treasures to be activated after obtaining 1 Treasure.
